OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers sacked for
OL,4,A'despicable' on-duty filming of
OL,5,Avulnerable people
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo male Police Service of Northern
OL,8,FIreland (PSNI) officers have been
OL,9,Fsacked for taking videos and photos of
OL,10,F18 vulnerable people they had been sent
OL,11,Fto help.
OL,13,FIn one video, a woman with learning
OL,14,Fdifficulties was filmed in bed and
OL,15,Fasked about her sex life.
OL,17,FThe two officers, identified as
OL,18,FOfficers A and B, had been tasked to
OL,19,Fher house in 2021 after a report of
OL,20,Fconcern for her safety.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
